  (text "4 x 5 SWITCH MATRIX; each key has a series 1N4148 for multi-key isolation." (at 35.56 20.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9f410246-61cf-47e7-8ef0-1a0000000003"))
  (text "Switch row nets: ROW0..ROW3. Column nets: COL0..COL4; Teensy inputs have 10k pull-ups to +3V3." (at 35.56 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9f410246-61cf-47e7-8ef0-1a0000000004"))
  (text "Button IDs are row-major: button = row * 5 + column + 1." (at 35.56 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9f410246-61cf-47e7-8ef0-1a0000000005"))
  (text "Each switch path: COLn -- switch --|>|-- ROWn (diode anode at COLn, cathode at ROWn)." (at 35.56 38.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9f410246-61cf-47e7-8ef0-1a0000000006"))
  (text "LED1..LED20: +5V_LED -- 470R -- LED anode; LED cathode -- TLC5947 OUT0..OUT19." (at 35.56 48.26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9f410246-61cf-47e7-8ef0-1a0000000007"))
  (text "U1 TLC5947: VCC=+3V3, GND=GND, SIN/SCLK/XLAT from J1; BLANK=GND, VPRG=GND." (at 35.56 53.34 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9f410246-61cf-47e7-8ef0-1a0000000008"))
  (text "IREF resistor sets maximum sink current; calculate and verify using the exact TI datasheet." (at 35.56 58.42 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9f410246-61cf-47e7-8ef0-1a0000000009"))
  (text "C1 10uF and C2/C3 100nF bypass +5V_LED and +3V3 at the loads." (at 35.56 63.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9f410246-61cf-47e7-8ef0-1a0000000010"))
  (text "J1: keyed 2x10 IDC. Pin 8=+5V_LED, pins 2/4=+5V_LED, pins 6/10=GND, pin 14=+3V3, pin 20 omitted." (at 35.56 68.58 0)
